    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Zion Exalted"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A song. A psalm of the sons of Korah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The Lord is great and highly praised",
          "in the city of our God.",
          "His holy mountain,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "rising splendidly,",
          "is the joy of the whole earth.",
          "Mount Zion #— #the summit of Zaphon #— #",
          "is the city of the great King."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "God is known as a stronghold",
          "in its citadels."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Look! The kings assembled;",
          "they advanced together."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They looked and froze with fear;",
          "they fled in terror."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Trembling seized them there,",
          "agony like that of a woman in labor,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "as you wrecked the ships of Tarshish",
          "with the east wind."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Just as we heard, so we have seen",
          "in the city of the Lord of Armies,",
          "in the city of our God;",
          "God will establish it forever."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "God, within your temple,",
          "we contemplate your faithful love."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Like your name, God, so your praise",
          "reaches to the ends of the earth;",
          "your right hand is filled with justice."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Mount Zion is glad.",
          "Judah’s villages rejoice",
          "because of your judgments."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Go around Zion, encircle it;",
          "count its towers,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "note its ramparts; tour its citadels",
          "so that you can tell a future generation:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“This God, our God forever and ever —",
          "he will always lead us.” ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      }
    ]
  },
